# Private model profiles are NOT committed to this repo by default - github
# allows dropping any number of your own *.sh files here (or copying them out
# of the private presets repo), and they stay untracked until you allowlist
# them. The pattern uses explicit filenames on purpose - a "!*/" re-include
# would un-ignore every subdirectory under this folder as well.
#
# Allowlisted (tracked) showcases:
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!gemma4-e2b.sh
!ornith-1.5-35b-a3b.sh